00;color:var(--ink,#1c1917);\">Footwork</span>\n</a>\n    <a class=\"tu-chapter-nav__link tu-chapter-nav__link--next\" href=\"../closed-and-neutral-stance-backhand/\" style=\"flex:1 1 30%;padding:0.85rem 1.15rem;border:1px solid var(--border,#e7e5e4);border-radius:8px;background:var(--card,#fff);text-decoration:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:0.25rem;text-align:right;\">\n  <span class=\"tu-chapter-nav__direction\" style=\"font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-dark,#047857);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;\">Next →</span>\n  <span class=\"tu-chapter-nav__title\" style=\"font-size:0.98rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink,#1c1917);\">Closed and Neutral Stance Backhand</span>\n</a>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n\n<!-- BOTTOM-NAV-START -->\n<hr style=\"margin:2.5rem 0 1.5rem; border:0; border-top:1px solid var(--border, #e7e5e4);\" />\n<nav class=\"tu-bottom-nav\" aria-label=\"Page navigation\" style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:1rem; margin:1.5rem 0 2rem; padding:1rem 1.25rem; background:var(--card, #fff); border:1px solid var(--border, #e7e5e4); border-radius:12px; box-shadow:var(--shadow, 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06));\">\n  <div class=\"tu-bottom-nav__prev\" style=\"flex:1; min-width:140px; text-align:left;\">\n    <a href=\"/tennis-technical-reference/footwork/ball-tracking-&-central-vision/\" style=\"color:var(--accent-dark, #047857); text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; font-size:0.92rem; display:inline-block;\">\n      ← Prev\n      <span style=\"font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:400; color:var(--ink-muted, #666); display:block; max-width:200px; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\">Ball Tracking &amp; Central Vision</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"tu-bottom-nav__home\" style=\"display:flex; gap:0.6rem; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:0 0.5rem; font-weight:600;\">\n    <a href=\"/\" style=\"color:var(--ink-muted, #555); text-decoration:none; padding:0.35rem 0.65rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg, #f3f4f6); font-size:0.9rem;\">🏠 Home</a>\n    <a href=\"/tennis-technical-reference/footwork/\" style=\"color:var(--accent-dark, #047857); text-decoration:none; padding:0.35rem 0.65rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--accent-light, #d1fae5); font-size:0.9rem;\">📚 Footwork</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"tu-bottom-nav__next\" style=\"flex:1; min-width:140px; text-align:right;\">\n    <a href=\"/tennis-technical-reference/footwork/closed-and-neutral-stance-backhand/\" style=\"color:var(--accent-dark, #047857); text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; font-size:0.92rem; display:inline-block;\">\n      Next →\n      <span style=\"font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:400; color:var(--ink-muted, #666); display:block; max-width:200px; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\">Closed and Neutral Stance Backhand</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n<!-- BOTTOM-NAV-END -->\n</article>"}, {"section": "footwork", "slug": "internal-shoulder-rotation-(isr)", "en_article": "<article class=\"md-content__inner md-typeset\">\n<h1 id=\"internal-shoulder-rotation-isr\">Internal Shoulder Rotation (Isr)<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#internal-shoulder-rotation-isr\" title=\"Permanent link\"></a></h1>\n<p><strong>Internal Shoulder Rotation (ISR)</strong>—the rapid medial rotation of the upper arm bone (humerus) toward the midline of the body—is the single largest biological generator of racket head velocity in the modern tennis serve and overhead, and plays a vital role in modern topspin groundstrokes.</p>\n<hr />\n\n<h2 id=\"footwork-as-the-rotational-trigger-for-isr\">Footwork as the Rotational Trigger for ISR</h2>\n<p>Internal Shoulder Rotation cannot occur efficiently without stable footwork. High-speed angular acceleration at the shoulder joint creates substantial rotational reaction moments through the torso and down into the pelvis. If the lower body is sliding or unanchored, this reaction torque spins the athlete's base out of control, causing loss of balance and erratic shot trajectories.</p>\n<p>Aggressive footwork positions the center of mass with precision, establishing a firm base of support. Decisive planting of the lead foot arrests linear travel, converting ground reaction force into trunk rotation, which subsequently slingshots the hitting arm into rapid internal rotation.</p>\n\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"related-concepts\">Related Concepts<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#related-concepts\" title=\"Permanent link\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../../biomechanics/the-kinetic-chain/\">The Kinetic Chain in Tennis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../ground-reaction-forces-(grf)/\">Ground Reaction Forces (GRF)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../stretch-shortening-cycle-(ssc)/\">The Stretch-Shortening Cycle (SSC)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../tennis-elbow-(lateral-epicondylitis)/\">Rotator Cuff Deceleration &amp; Elbow Health</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../x-factor-(shoulder-hip-separation)/\">The X-Factor &amp; Shoulder-Hip Separation</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong><a href=\"../../../vi/tennis-technical-reference/footwork/internal-shoulder-rotation-isr/\">Đọc bằng Tiếng Việt</a></strong> — Phiên bản tiếng Việt của tài liệu kỹ thuật này.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<div class=\"video-embed-card\" style=\"margin:2.25rem 0;padding:1.25rem;background:var(--card,#fff);border:1px solid var(--border,#e7e5e4);border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08);\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:0.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-dark,#047857);text-transform:uppercase;background:var(--card-hover,#f4fdf7);padding:0.25rem 0.6rem;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid var(--border,#e7e5e4);\">BATCH 5 &middot; FOOTWORK MASTERCLASS</span>\n    <span style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--muted,#78716c);\">Tennis Haus</span>\n  </div>\n  <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 0.75rem;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.4;color:var(--ink,#1c1917);\">Tennis footwork | Dr. Mark Kovacs taking about the importance of movement and testing</h4>\n  <div style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;height:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.15);\">\n    <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iPbud5GUCO0?rel=0&modestbranding=1\" title=\"Tennis footwork | Dr. Mark Kovacs taking about the importance of movement and testing\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\" height=\"100%\"></iframe>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<nav class=\"tu-chapter-nav\" aria-label=\"Bottom Page Navigation\" style=\"margin:3rem 0 1.5rem;padding-top:1.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border,#e7e5e4);\">\n  <div class=\"tu-chapter-nav__inner\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:stretch;gap:0.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n    <a class=\"tu-chapter-nav__link tu-chapter-nav__link--prev\" href=\"../implicit-decision-trees/\" style=\"flex:1 1 30%;padding:0.85rem 1.15rem;border:1px solid var(--border,#e7e5e4);border-radius:8px;background:var(--card,#fff);text-decoration:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.25rem;\">\n  <span class=\"tu-chapter-nav__direction\" style=\"font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-dark,#047857);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;\">← Previous</span>\n  <span class=\"tu-chapter-nav__title\" style=\"font-size:0.98rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink,#1c1917);\">Implicit Decision Trees</span>\n</a>\n    <a class=\"tu-chapter-nav__link tu-chapter-nav__link--home\" href=\"../\" style=\"flex:0 1 auto;padding:0.85rem 1.25rem;border:1px solid var(--border,#e7e5e4);border-radius:8px;background:var(--card,#fff);text-decoration:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:0.25rem;\">\n  <span class=\"tu-chapter-nav__direction\" style=\"font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-dark,#047857);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;\">🏠 Index / Home</span>\n  <span class=\"tu-chapter-nav__title\" style=\"font-size:0.98rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink,#1c1917);\">Footwork</span>\n</a>\n    <a class=\"tu-chapter-nav__link tu-chapter-nav__link--next\" href=\"../lag-mechanics/\" style=\"flex:1 1 30%;padding:0.85rem 1.15rem;border:1px solid var(--border,#e7e5e4);border-radius:8px;background:var(--card,#fff);text-decoration:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:0.25rem;text-align:right;\">\n  <span class=\"tu-chapter-nav__direction\" style=\"font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-dark,#047857);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;\">Next →</span>\n  <span class=\"tu-chapter-nav__title\" style=\"font-size:0.98rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink,#1c1917);\">Racquet Lag in Modern Tennis</span>\n</a>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n\n<!-- BOTTOM-NAV-START -->\n<hr style=\"margin:2.5rem 0 1.5rem; border:0; border-top:1px solid var(--border, #e7e5e4);\" />\n<nav class=\"tu-bottom-nav\" aria-label=\"Page navigation\" style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:1rem; margin:1.5rem 0 2rem; padding:1rem 1.25rem; background:var(--card, #fff); border:1px solid var(--border, #e7e5e4); border-radius:12px; box-shadow:var(--shadow, 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06));\">\n  <div class=\"tu-bottom-nav__prev\" style=\"flex:1; min-width:140px; text-align:left;\">\n    <a href=\"/tennis-technical-reference/footwork/\" style=\"color:var(--accent-dark, #047857); text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; font-size:0.92rem; display:inline-block;\">\n      ← Prev\n      <span style=\"font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:400; color:var(--ink-muted, #666); display:block; max-width:200px; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\">Footwork & Movement</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"tu-bottom-nav__home\" style=\"dis